{"ref":"BDB, בְּאֹשׁ","hw":"בְּאֹשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאֹשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. stench</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> cstr. <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאְשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:20\" href=\"/Joel.2.20\">Jo 2:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאְשָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.3\">Is 34:3</a>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ מַחֲנֵיכֶם</span>, i.e. <em>stench</em> of corpses <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a>, also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.3\">Is 34:3</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:20\" href=\"/Joel.2.20\">Jo 2:20</a> of locusts <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה בּ׳</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּעַל צַחֲנָתוֹ</span>).","next":"BDB, בָּאְשָׁה","prev":"BDB, בָּאַשׁ"}